LEN NEW
TIT 'OSDEye'                     ! Note the title is enclosed in single quotes.
WL 656.27 587.56 486.13
EPD 6                            ! Increase the entrance pupil diameter to 6 mm.
YAN 0        14      25          ! Add fields.
INS S1.2                         ! Second surface of the lens.
STOP S2
RDY S1       7.8                 ! Radius of curvature of the cornea.
THI S1       3.6                 ! Thickness of the crystalline lens.
GLA S1       WATER               ! Water for the vitreous humor.
RDY S2       10                  ! Radius curvature of the front surface of the lens.
THI S2       3.6                 ! Thickness of the lens.
GLA S2       1.415:47.0          ! Refractive index and V-number of the lens.
RDY S3       -6                  ! Radius of the back surface of the lens.
GLA S3       WATER               ! Water for the aqueous humor.
RDY S4       -10                 ! Radius of curvature of the retina.
PIM                              ! Solve for the distance to the retina.
FIR
INS S4                           ! Insert air space to get the correct focal lengths.
FIR
